    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78142" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακειμένως</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>similarly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκύφος π. ἔχων τὰ ὦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					11.489b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>next, following</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ περὶ θεῶν λόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					1.8.1
				</span></i>
			 (dub.); <i>in the next place</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.22.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.227
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>conveniently</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.22.90
			</span></i>.</div>
